 - 2026-06-30: PHASE B3 (INFRA; RESERVED SLOT 2 of 2; THE PERMANENT 404/SKELETON-BAIL FIX; claude/opus) -- ship python/carnot/moat_trainer.py: (a) resolve_trainable_base() probes a PRIORITIZED list of REAL cached bases [Qwen3.5-2B, Qwen3.5-0.8B, Qwen3-4B, Qwen2.5-0.5B] and returns the first PRESENT (kills the hallucinated-repo class forever); (b) train_energy_head() = QLoRA + scalar energy head, checkpoint-per-epoch, resumable; (c) a 60-SECOND SMOKE that trains a few steps on a real base + checkpoints, PROVING the pipeline end-to-end BEFORE D1's full run. D1 is gated_on this smoke. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success_moat_trainer_module_shipped_smoke_trained_Qwen_Qwen35-2B; results/experiment_5030_moat_trainer_module.json
 - 2026-06-30: PHASE D2 (VERIFIER MOAT; the published WIN-CONDITION existence proof) -- REPLICATE uPRM (arXiv:2605.10158) over the FIXED B2 logprob cache: the next-token-prob first-error process score as an oracle-distinct SELECTOR over K candidates, gate beats-GENUINE-tuned-SC (B1) with McNemar CI95-excl-0 on MuSR. SELF-SUPERVISED frozen-candidate PRM FALLBACK (arXiv:2507.01951 / 2502.14356) that needs NO logprobs, so D2 is NOT single-point-blocked by B2. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete_uprm_no_win_musr_minus_0p110_mcnemar_or_headroom_gate; results/experiment_5032_uprm_replication_v3.json
 - 2026-06-30: PHASE D3 (VERIFIER MOAT; the uncertainty-aware construction, NON-DEGENERATE; gated_on D1) -- rebuild EBRM (arXiv:2504.13134): refine the REAL D1 trained LoRA-EBM scorer (gated_on D1 scorer_trained), add uncertainty heads (UARM 2606.19818 + distributional-pessimistic 2606.09073 + CoT-Entropy 2502.11250) + CONFORMAL abstention (CROP 2605.30085) CAPPED <=50% so the selector cannot collapse to always-SC (the B1 degeneracy guard). Gate beats-GENUINE-tuned-SC on MuSR. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete_ebrm_no_win_musr_plus_0p080_ci_incl_0; results/experiment_5033_ebrm_uncertainty_verifier_v3.json
+- 2026-06-30: PHASE D6 (VERIFIER MOAT; the EFFICIENCY axis -- north-star §5 Pareto win) -- the uncertainty-routed cheap-verifier -> strong-judge CASCADE (arXiv:2510.20369) with VERDI-style confidence routing (arXiv:2605.11334, confidence from sub-check traces, no extra judge calls): the cheap oracle-distinct verifier selects when confident and routes ONLY uncertain questions to a strong LLM-judge. WIN = accuracy parity (within CI) with the judge-only baseline at MATERIALLY FEWER judge calls. Charge the judge budget explicitly. (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=blocked_judge_server; results/experiment_5034_uncertainty_routed_cascade_v2.json
